<zk>
	<label multiline="true">
		Steps to reproduce:
		1. Open the cascader, click "Japan" (do not pick Tokyo or Kyoto), then click the grey area.
		- Expected: the icon is the dropdown arrow, not the clear icon (×), and the server-side
			selection below stays "none" with no onSelect.
		2. Open the cascader again.
		- Expected: nothing is highlighted and only the first column is shown.
		3. Repeat 1-2, closing the popup with Escape, with Tab, by clicking the field, or by
			clicking the arrow icon instead.
		4. Pick Japan > Tokyo. Open the cascader, click "USA", then click the grey area.
		- Expected: the field still reads "Japan/Tokyo", and reopening highlights Japan and Tokyo,
			not USA.
		- Bug: the clicked parent was kept as the selection when the popup closed without a pick.
		5. Pick Japan > Tokyo, click the clear icon (×), open the cascader, then click the grey area.
		- Expected: the icon is the dropdown arrow, and reopening highlights nothing.
		6. Reload, press Tab to focus the empty cascader, then press Backspace.
		- Expected: the onSelect count stays 0.
		7. Pick Japan > Tokyo, click "cas.setDisabled(true)", click the cascader, then press Backspace.
		- Expected: the field still reads "Japan/Tokyo", and the server keeps Tokyo.
	</label>
	<zscript><![CDATA[
	DefaultTreeNode newYork = new DefaultTreeNode("New York");
	DefaultTreeModel model = new DefaultTreeModel(new DefaultTreeNode("ROOT",
		Arrays.asList(new DefaultTreeNode[]{
			new DefaultTreeNode("USA", Arrays.asList(new TreeNode[]{newYork, new DefaultTreeNode("Los Angeles")})),
			new DefaultTreeNode("Japan", Arrays.asList(new TreeNode[]{new DefaultTreeNode("Tokyo"), new DefaultTreeNode("Kyoto")}))
		})));
	]]></zscript>
	<cascader id="cas" width="300px" model="${model}" placeholder="Pick a city"
			  onSelect='sel.setValue(self.getSelectedItem() == null ? "none" : self.getSelectedItem().toString());
			  count.setValue(String.valueOf(Integer.parseInt(count.getValue()) + 1));'/>
	<hlayout>
		<label value="Selected item (server):"/>
		<label id="sel" value="none"/>
		<label value="onSelect count:"/>
		<label id="count" value="0"/>
	</hlayout>
	<hlayout>
		<button id="serverClose" label="cas.setOpen(false)" onClick="cas.setOpen(false)"/>
		<button id="serverSelect" label="cas.setSelectedItem(New York)"
				onClick="cas.setSelectedItem(newYork); sel.setValue(cas.getSelectedItem().toString());"/>
		<button id="serverDisable" label="cas.setDisabled(true)" onClick="cas.setDisabled(true)"/>
	</hlayout>
	<div id="outside" height="120px" style="background: #eee">outside</div>
</zk>
